B.P8=new A.Y(B.Ps,["Photos","Links","Take photo","Choose photos","Could not add the photo","Delete this photo?","Delete this link?","Add link","Edit link","Label","Share","Optional","How to use","Screens and common tasks","Skip","Next","Back","Get started","What is Temoto CRM?","A CRM in your pocket: manage accounts, deals and anything else with your own fields.\n\n- All data stays on this device\n- Switch screens with the tabs: Home / Objects / Pipeline / ToDo / Settings\n- Home shows counts, deal amounts and today's to-dos","Add records",'An "object" is a table such as Accounts or Deals; a "record" is one row.\n\n- Objects tab > pick a table > tap + at the bottom right\n- On a record, tap a phone, email, URL or address to call, mail, browse or open maps\n- Long-press a value to copy it\n- Use "New" in a related list to create a linked record\n- Attach any number of photos (camera or library) and links with + under "Photos" and "Links" on a record',"Build your own fields",'Use the tune button at the top right of the Objects tab (Objects & fields) to create tables and fields.\n\n- Field types: text, number, currency, date, picklist, checkbox, phone, email, address, reference and more\n- A "reference" links two tables and adds a related list to the other record\n- In "Object settings" choose the name field, pipeline columns, amount and reminder date',"Find records","- Search by name or content at the top\n- Use the sort and filter buttons to set conditions\n- Save frequent conditions as a named view (long-press a view to edit or delete it)\n- Choose which fields appear in the list","Pipeline","See progress as columns of cards, one column per picklist value (e.g. deal stage).\n\n- Long-press a card and drag it to another column\n- Or use the \u22ee menu on the card\n- Each column shows its count and total amount","To-dos and reminders","In Object settings, choose a reminder date and a done checkbox; records then appear in the ToDo tab by due date.\n\n- You get a notification at the due time (9:00 for date-only fields)\n- Check a record to mark it done and stop its reminder\n- No notifications? Settings > allow notifications","Keep your data safe","- Export and import CSV (e.g. with Excel)\n- Device backup: save all data to one file and restore it later\n- Online backup (paid): encrypted on your device and saved to the cloud automatically; also for moving to a new phone. A forgotten passphrase cannot be recovered\n\nOpen this guide any time from Settings > How to use, or the ? at the top right of Home.","Temoto CRM","About the web version","Data is stored only in this browser","The web version stores data only in this browser (not encrypted). It holds customer personal data, so do not use it on shared PCs or other people's browsers.","This is the web version of Temoto CRM. Differences from the app:\n\n- Data (including photos) is stored only in this browser and never sent to us. It is not shared with other browsers or devices, and is lost if you clear site data. Export a backup regularly.\n- Data in the browser is not encrypted. Because it holds customer personal data, do not use it on shared PCs or other people's browsers, and lock your device.\n- No online backup (premium), due-date notifications or ads. Due to-dos are shown on screen when you open the app.\n- Backups and CSV are imported by choosing a file and exported by sharing or downloading. Photos are chosen from files.\n- Backup files (.temotocrm) can be moved between the app and the web version.","Due now","Open to-do","Get the app (notifications, online backup)","Home","Objects","Pipeline","To-do","Settings","Save","Cancel","Delete","Edit","New","Add","OK","Close","Search","Required",'Please fill in "{0}"','Delete "{0}"? This cannot be undone.',"Deleted","Saved","Nothing here yet","{0} records","Load more","Sort","Filter","Ascending","Descending","Views","All","Save view","View name","Delete this view","Columns","Add condition","Clear conditions","Value","Name","Created","Last modified","contains","equals","not equal to","greater / after","at least / on or after","less / before","at most / on or before","is empty","is not empty","is checked","is not checked","Related","Details","Select","None","Clear","Yes","No","Call","Email","Map","Open","Copy","Copied","Objects & fields","Add object","Object name","Icon","Color","Fields","Add field","Field name","Type","Options (one per line)","Related object","Currency","Show in list","Name field","Pipeline columns (picklist)","Amount (for totals)","Reminder date","Done checkbox","Object settings",'Delete "{0}" and all {1} records in it?','Delete field "{0}" and its values?',"Text","Long text","Number","Currency","Percent","Date","Date/time","Picklist","Checkbox","Phone","Email","URL","Address","Lookup","Welcome to Temoto CRM","Your data stays on this phone. Choose how to start.","Sales CRM (recommended)","Accounts, contacts, opportunities and activities. Change anything later.","Add sample data","Start from scratch","Build your own objects and fields.","Start","Total","Count","Amount","By stage","Overdue","Today","Upcoming","No due date","Show completed",'To use the pipeline, choose a picklist field as "Pipeline columns" in an object\'s settings.','To use to-dos, choose a "Reminder date" in an object\'s settings.',"Move to","(none)","Recently modified","Appearance","Theme","System","Light","Dark","Language","System","Data","Export CSV","Import CSV","Map columns to fields","(skip)","Imported {0} records ({1} values left empty)","The CSV has no rows","On-device backup","Export backup","Restore from backup","This replaces all current data. Continue?","Restored","This file cannot be read","Online backup","Premium","Encrypted cloud backup with automatic daily backups and easy transfer to a new phone.","Monthly","Yearly","Subscribe","Restore purchases","Subscribed","Store is not available","Online backup is coming soon. Please use on-device backup.","Sign in","Create account","Sign out","Delete account","This deletes your account and all backups stored in the cloud. Data on this device is kept. This cannot be undone. To cancel the subscription, use your store subscription settings.","Account deleted","Online backup is an auto-renewable subscription (monthly or yearly). It renews automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Payment is charged to your Apple ID or Google account. Manage or cancel it in your store subscription settings.","Email","Password","Backup passphrase","Used to encrypt on this device and never sent to the server. Lost passphrases cannot be recovered (8+ characters).","Back up now","Automatic backup (daily)","Cloud backups","Restore","Last: {0}","Backed up","Wrong passphrase or damaged data","About","Terms of use","Privacy policy","Version","Error: {0}","Reminder","Allow notifications to get reminders","Erase all data","Erase all objects, fields and records and return to the welcome screen?","Reorder","Choose",'Temoto CRM Terms of Use\n\n1. This app is provided by St.Arkid ("we").\n2. Your data is stored on your device. You are responsible for managing and backing it up.\n3. Online backup (paid) is an auto-renewing subscription. Cancel any time from your App Store / Google Play subscription settings. No refunds for partial periods.\n4. We are not liable for damages arising from use of the app, except in cases of our intent or gross negligence.\n5. These terms may change; continued use means you accept the changes.\n\nContact: https://st.arkid.jp','Temoto CRM Privacy Policy\n\n- Accounts, contacts and other data you enter are stored only on your device; we never receive them.\n- Only if you use online backup, your email address (for sign-in) and a backup file encrypted on your device with your passphrase are stored in Google Firebase. We cannot read the unencrypted contents.\n- Purchases are processed by the App Store / Google Play.\n- We do not collect data for advertising or tracking.\n- You can delete your account and all cloud backups at any time with "Delete account" on the Online backup screen.\n\nContact: https://st.arkid.jp'],t.w)
